{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33063","headline":"寄贾驰先辈 · 曹邺","name":"寄贾驰先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游子想万里，何必登高台。\n闻君燕女吟，如自蓟北来。\n长安高盖多，健马东西街。\n尽说蒿簪古，将钱买金钗。\n我祖西园事，言之独伤怀。\n如今数君子，如鸟无树栖。\n济水一入河，便与清流乖。\n闻君欲自持，勿使吾道低。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}